# Attempt archives: preserved run evidence IS tracked (logs, reports, profile
# metadata), but ROM-derived binaries stay out per the release policy above —
# they are archived on disk only. Order matters: the re-include must follow
# the general excludes, and the binary excludes must follow the re-include.
!run1_archive/
!run1_archive/**
run1_archive/**/*.ss1
run1_archive/**/*.sav
